**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
# flutter tool 在包目录里落的状态文件（含 workspace 成员）
.flutter
.flutter_tool_state
.pub-cache/
.pub/
**/build/
**/.dart_tool/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# 第三方原生解释器源码：按 apps/qfli_c/native/README.md 的命令 clone 进来，
